---
// TestimonialsGrid.astro
---
<section class="os8-section" id="onesuite-reviews">
  <div class="os8-container">
    <div class="os8-header">
      <div class="os8-eyebrow">CUSTOMER REVIEWS</div>
      <h2>Loved by Businesses <span>Around the World.</span></h2>
      <p class="os8-subtitle">See what OneSuite customers say about managing their clients, projects and everyday business operations.</p>
      <div class="os8-rating">
        <span class="os8-stars">★★★★★</span>
        Real customer feedback
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="os8-grid">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="os8-card">
        <div class="os8-quote-mark">“</div>
        <div class="os8-card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="os8-review-text">Every update improves usability and performance. The support team is responsive and genuinely invested in my success. OneSuite keeps exceeding expectations.</p>
        <div class="os8-divider"></div>
        <div class="os8-author-row">
          <div class="os8-avatar" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3F7FF5, #2961e0)">JL</div>
          <div class="os8-author-info">
            <strong>Jacquelyn L.</strong>
            <small>Small-Business Owner</small>
          </div>
          <div class="os8-flag">🇺🇸</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="os8-card">
        <div class="os8-quote-mark">“</div>
        <div class="os8-card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="os8-review-text">OneSuite consolidated our entire agency stack. Client portal, invoicing, e-signatures, and lead management, all in one place. We cut subscriptions, reduced overhead, and now deliver faster.</p>
        <div class="os8-divider"></div>
        <div class="os8-author-row">
          <div class="os8-avatar" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7F56D9, #6941C6)">LP</div>
          <div class="os8-author-info">
            <strong>Luca Piccinotti</strong>
            <small>COO at DEQUA Studio</small>
          </div>
          <div class="os8-flag">🇮🇹</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="os8-card">
        <div class="os8-quote-mark">“</div>
        <div class="os8-card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="os8-review-text">OneSuite became our daily driver. It gives the team a clean, structured space to plan and execute every week, with far fewer clicks.</p>
        <div class="os8-divider"></div>
        <div class="os8-author-row">
          <div class="os8-avatar" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F79009, #DC6803)">SA</div>
          <div class="os8-author-info">
            <strong>Sartaj Anand</strong>
            <small>CEO at Egomonk</small>
          </div>
          <div class="os8-flag">🇮🇳</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div class="os8-card">
        <div class="os8-quote-mark">“</div>
        <div class="os8-card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="os8-review-text">Great for keeping track of several projects at once. Lets me assign priority so I always focus on what matters most. Easy to use from day one.</p>
        <div class="os8-divider"></div>
        <div class="os8-author-row">
          <div class="os8-avatar" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #12B76A, #039855)">CC</div>
          <div class="os8-author-info">
            <strong>Carlos Castellanos</strong>
            <small>Managing Partner</small>
          </div>
          <div class="os8-flag">🇺🇸</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Card 5 -->
      <div class="os8-card">
        <div class="os8-quote-mark">“</div>
        <div class="os8-card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="os8-review-text">I used to live in Notion and hated it. OneSuite is clean and simple, and the CRM is so good I'm in it for hours every day. It feels complete.</p>
        <div class="os8-divider"></div>
        <div class="os8-author-row">
          <div class="os8-avatar" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F04438, #D92D20)">EL</div>
          <div class="os8-author-info">
            <strong>Eryk Lewandowski</strong>
            <small>CEO at Flowbound</small>
          </div>
          <div class="os8-flag">🇵🇱</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Card 6 -->
      <div class="os8-card">
        <div class="os8-quote-mark">“</div>
        <div class="os8-card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="os8-review-text">I've used it for 5 months to manage client projects and assign tasks. So intuitive. You don't need to explain to your team where to find anything. Nothing escapes me now.</p>
        <div class="os8-divider"></div>
        <div class="os8-author-row">
          <div class="os8-avatar" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3F7FF5, #1849B0)">PC</div>
          <div class="os8-author-info">
            <strong>Pedro Colmenárez</strong>
            <small>CEO at Pedro Pixel</small>
          </div>
          <div class="os8-flag">🇪🇨</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Card 7 -->
      <div class="os8-card">
        <div class="os8-quote-mark">“</div>
        <div class="os8-card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="os8-review-text">For our sales workflow it just works. The client signs, pays, and your routes automatically. OneSuite looks great and keeps getting better.</p>
        <div class="os8-divider"></div>
        <div class="os8-author-row">
          <div class="os8-avatar" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #EE46BC, #C11574)">DE</div>
          <div class="os8-author-info">
            <strong>Dennis Eideland</strong>
            <small>Founder at Ojoo</small>
          </div>
          <div class="os8-flag">🇫🇷</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Card 8 -->
      <div class="os8-card">
        <div class="os8-quote-mark">“</div>
        <div class="os8-card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="os8-review-text">The client directory, invoicing, and leads management are outstanding. Months in and I still haven't found anything I don't like. It's become indispensable for daily operations.</p>
        <div class="os8-divider"></div>
        <div class="os8-author-row">
          <div class="os8-avatar" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0BA5EC, #026AA2)">SS</div>
          <div class="os8-author-info">
            <strong>Surja Sen</strong>
            <small>Product Design Lead at GoDaddy</small>
          </div>
          <div class="os8-flag">🇨🇦</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Card 9 -->
      <div class="os8-card">
        <div class="os8-quote-mark">“</div>
        <div class="os8-card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="os8-review-text">Managing all client projects in one platform has transformed how we work. Team statistics, task records, employee effort, everything tracked in a single source of truth.</p>
        <div class="os8-divider"></div>
        <div class="os8-author-row">
          <div class="os8-avatar" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7F56D9, #53389E)">SR</div>
          <div class="os8-author-info">
            <strong>Shah Razi Siddiqui</strong>
            <small>CEO at CODETREE</small>
          </div>
          <div class="os8-flag">🇧🇩</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="os8-bottom">
      <div class="os8-bottom-left">
        <span class="os8-bottom-stars">★★★★★</span>
        <span class="os8-bottom-text">Ready to simplify your client workflow?</span>
      </div>
      <a href="https://app.onesuite.io" class="os8-button">Start Your Free Trial &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .os8-section {
    padding: 110px 20px;
    background: #ffffff;
  }
  .os8-container {
    max-width: 1110px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .os8-header {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .os8-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    padding: 7px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #f1f5ff;
    border: 1px solid #d9e5ff;
    color: #3F7FF5;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }
  .os8-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 56px);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    margin: 16px 0 0 0;
    color: #101828;
  }
  .os8-header h2 span {
    color: #3F7FF5;
  }
  .os8-subtitle {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 16px auto 0;
    color: #667085;
    font-size: 17px;
  }
  .os8-rating {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 14px;
    padding: 7px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #fffbeb;
    border: 1px solid #fde68a;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #92400e;
  }
  .os8-stars {
    color: #f5b800;
  }
  .os8-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 50px;
  }
  .os8-card {
    background: #fafbfc;
    border: 1px solid #eaecf0;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 26px 24px;
    min-height: 275px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .os8-quote-mark {
    font-size: 38px;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    color: #e4e7ec;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .os8-card-stars {
    color: #f5b800;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .os8-review-text {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #344054;
    line-height: 1.65;
    flex: 1;
    margin: 12px 0;
  }
  .os8-divider {
    border-top: 1px dashed #dfe3e8;
    padding-top: 16px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .os8-author-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 11px;
  }
  .os8-avatar {
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .os8-author-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .os8-author-info strong {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #101828;
  }
  .os8-author-info small {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #98a2b3;
  }
  .os8-flag {
    margin-left: auto;
  }
  .os8-bottom {
    margin-top: 50px;
    padding: 28px 32px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: #f8faff;
    border: 1px solid #e4e7ec;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .os8-bottom-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .os8-bottom-stars {
    color: #f5b800;
  }
  .os8-bottom-text {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #101828;
  }
  .os8-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0 28px;
    min-height: 48px;
    background: #3F7FF5;
    color: white;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 750;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
  }
  .os8-button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.20);
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .os8-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .os8-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .os8-bottom {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 24px 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
